rse/backwash; both low = coast)." (at 20 433 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 9ec4a1fe-63fb-4c7f-8d8a-3fd2cc0ea7ef)) (text "Valve: GPIO2 -> AO3400A, M7 flyback across the coil. EC: GPIO25 -> 330 R -> E1 ... E2 -> 100 R -> GPIO26;" (at 20 436.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 3779c96f-855d-4efc-9c46-1054ce0b967a)) (text "alternate polarity every 250 us, sample EC_N1 in each phase: (Rc + Rb) / (Rref + Ra) = V_A / V_B, independent" (at 20 439.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid e3488aae-ec45-4dc3-ac62-e4e1a404972d)) (text "of the 3.3 V level; both pins low when idle (no DC on the electrodes). Optics: LEDs from 12 V through 1 k" (at 20 443.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 33e88244-de1a-4752-84c2-27f820df50d7)) (text "(about 9-10 mA); TIA gains 10 k (transmission) and 1 M (scatter): tune so clear water reads 1.5-2.5 V." (at 20 446.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 651f40f9-d866-4db5-89dd-51295aaccc0e)) (text "Sump/leak probes are pulsed from GPIO27 only while sampled." (at 20 450 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 984b20c4-c45f-4d90-9b24-e3f69cadb3bb)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))